<title>JAPAN: NGK Insulators to buy back its shares.</title>
<headline>NGK Insulators to buy back its shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NGK Insulators Ltd said on Thursday it had decided to buy back up to 10 million of its own shares or up to 15 billion yen worth.</p>
</text>
